Z||000000||dr fritz||06-10-2001||07:11 PM||||when converting 2.8 to 3.1... are the same intake manifolds used? is their a better aftermarket intake manifold to use?<P>  also is the 2.8 wrist pin compatible to the 3.1 rod? <P>  can anyone recommend the best piston for the buck?<P>  what type of injector will work best for this application?<P>  has anyone played around with the throttle body diameter?<P>   tanx in advance for all your help<P>||||reg||5
